        {
            "created": "2022-11-23T09:48:31.825487",
            "description": "This ressource contains the .m file necessary to generate the hydrognss dataset\r\nINPUT: daily GNSS vertical displacements (.mom file) to which NTAL, NTOL, SLEL, GIA and TB have been substracted in advance, \r\n       daily HYDL time series, and\r\n       monthly GRACE-derived displacements\r\nOUTPUT: hydrognss time series monthly\r\n\r\nIMPORTANT NOTE: we consider that, in a preprocessing step, all data-sets have been equalized in time (same number of epochs for HYDL and GPS)\r\nFor the comparison with GRACE: we consider that epochs corresponding to GRACE follow on have been eliminated in a preprocessing step from all data-set\r\n",
            "format": "matlab",
            "last_modified": "2022-11-23T09:50:36.327817",
            "mimetype": "application/vnd.wolfram.mathematica.package",
            "name": ".m Matlab file to generate hydrognss",
            "position": 2,
            "size": 9373,
            "state": "active",
            "url": "https://data.uni-hannover.de/dataset/f03e101b-a7cb-4e7d-9b60-436a52e703dd/resource/618068c0-6479-478d-900c-ccc67f7b68b0/download/generate_hydrognss.m",
            "url_type": ""
        },
